"id": "26470285812600015"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\nDrone Core Command v0.65\n\nNew\n- Fixed a bug with controllers not working as expected.  Game should now be playable with both hand tracking and controllers\n- Fixed a bug with missiles causing a performance hitch\n- Fixed some collision issues with projectiles\n\nKnown Bugs\n- Some art assets are still in progress given the new performance push\n\nFuture\n- continued optimizations\n- systems balancing still in progress so any feedback here is appreciated\n- XR gameplay is in development, but not ready for release into production channel yet.", "created_date": 1777928271, "id": "26469285879366675", "version": "0.65", "version_code": 65, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25243862388575703", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26470285812600015"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "Drone Core Command v0.64\n\nNew\n- Heavy push on optimization\n\nKnown Bugs\n- Some art assets are still in progress given the new performance push\n\nFuture\n- continued optimizations\n- systems balancing still in progress so any feedback here is appreciated\n- XR gameplay is in development, but not ready for release into production channel yet.", "created_date": 1777668943, "id": "26438033285825268", "version": "0.64", "version_code": 64, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_re