ndtrack so it may pop periodically\n\nFuture\n- continued optimizations\n- systems balancing still in progress so any feedback here is appreciated\n- XR gameplay is in development, but not ready for release into production channel yet.", "created_date": 1775619147, "id": "26176694761959123", "version": "0.62", "version_code": 62, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}